   |
14 |     move h.r.handle //~ ERROR cannot move `h.r.handle` out of `Res`, which defines a custom `drop`
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: add a `take`-style method that returns `h.r.handle` instead

error[E517]: cannot move `Res` out of a borrow
  --> main/main.kg:18:10
   |
18 |     move h.r //~ ERROR cannot move `Res` out of a borrow
   |          ^^^

error[E1022]: cannot move a value out of an index
